038578138'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5781888074602383450/comments/default/536432883038578138'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/03/theyre-all-heroes-no-matter-what-laws.html?showComment=1488985892823#c536432883038578138' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='//3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/03/theyre-all-heroes-no-matter-what-laws.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5781888074602383450' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5781888074602383450' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 8, 2017 at 8:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2749997987882006644</id><published>2017-03-08T04:25:56.405-07:00</published><updated>2017-03-08T04:25:56.405-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This is a well written, thought provoking piece......</title><content type='html'>This is a well written, thought provoking piece...like many others on this blog.  We live in an age and information community that involves a lot of consensus propaganda about both property rights and the authority of a detached government to enforce behaviors - e.g. &amp;quot;You can be arrested and charged for straying into this billionaire&amp;#39;s private beach&amp;quot; &amp;amp; &amp;quot;You can be arrested and charged for various forms of protest against foreign military adventures that you are only allowed to hear lies about, because your government has empowered the war makers to keep the truth a top secret and to routinely tell lies about their activities.&amp;quot;   Thinking about choices in past situations, now recognized as clearly unjust, helps people gain perspective.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ve put together a list of &amp;quot;IndyNews&amp;quot; sources that now includes Pro Libertate: http://www.mediafire.com/file/15vubeeh3fxamcc/IndyNewsRSS.html  This single page can be downloaded and displayed in the browser, giving easy access to RSS, URLs, and Twitter account names.   Many of the listed blogs often run pieces written by 3rd party authors, and some of the sites specialize in that.  Many of them use the DISQUS system for comments.  It is not a perfect system, but it has the advantage of making it easy for one to keep track of replies on multiple sites.  Users have the option of making their collected activity private, but I have left my profile public: https://disqus.com/by/JJ_Stern/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5781888074602383450/comments/default/2749997987882006644'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5781888074602383450/comments/default/2749997987882006644'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/03/theyre-all-heroes-no-matter-what-laws.html?showComment=1488972356405#c2749997987882006644' title=''/><author><name>Josh Stern</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13380724772623367555</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/03/theyre-all-heroes-no-matter-what-laws.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5781888074602383450' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5781888074602383450' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-368474403"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 8, 2017 at 4:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1514288779485867429</id><published>2017-03-07T21:45:07.392-07:00</published><updated>2017-03-07T21:45:07.392-07:00</updated><title type='text'>You apparently don&amp;#39;t have a statute of limitat...</title><content type='html'>You apparently don&amp;#39;t have a statute of limitations.  How about your heritage for the last 2000 years.&lt;br /&gt;Or even the Mormons that did NOT appoint blacks as pastors until 1978.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Oh, yes, in 2017, we can look back and condemn people?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Since 1974, 60 MILLION dead babies.  Do you care?  Do they matter?  Oh, they are YOUR generation&amp;#39;s grave collective sin.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Slavery was 150 years ago or more.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Their blood is not on my hands, my great-grandparents were not in the USA.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Yet too many complain about ancient crimes rather than notice they are up to their necks - soon to be drowning in the blood of innocents - in their own time and space.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;One cannot point to other&amp;#39;s sins, wither in time or space to justify their commission - or OMISSION.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Close the nearest abortion clinic.  Only then look deep into the past to condemn.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5781888074602383450/comments/default/1514288779485867429'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5781888074602383450/comments/default/1514288779485867429'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/03/theyre-all-heroes-no-matter-what-laws.html?